  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You to Know When To Hold Em 3 Kings / 4 Queen Bunks / 2 Sleeper Sofas<br><br>“Why gamble with your vacation?” Pinkie Flamingo could never understand anyone taking that kind of risk when a sure thing is on the table. Card sharks and savvy travelers know the deal…always go with the winner! The deck is stacked in your favor right here for a wonderful vacation experience with a priceless location in the heart of Inlet Beach.<br>Take the perfect combination of the classic “old Florida” vibe and the “up and coming” energy of a new community and you have described Inlet Beach. Nestled between Lake Powell and the Gulf of Mexico lies your new favorite vacation destination. Discover Emerald Coast Dream House! Appealing to many for it's more laid back and carefree mood, the area of Inlet Beach joins the all-star line-up of 30A Beaches but still retains its quaint charm and quiet, unhurried pace.<br><br>Endless recreational and entertainment opportunities are all within easy grasp. Visitors delight in discovering the boutiques, trendy shops and popular restaurants in the fashionable #30Avenue Shopping Center...Just minutes for this vacation home. With an ideal location within the popular community of Grande Pointe, Emerald Coast Dream House is just steps to the resort-style seasonally heated swimming pool and clubhouse and 30 seconds from the private dock on Lake Powell. Nestled against Camp Helen State Park, this vacation rental features a private backyard with screen porch and propane gas grill. Enjoy some of the most beautiful beaches along 30A at the Inlet Beach Public Access …within 5 minutes by car or bikes.<br><br>Every gambler knows that the secret to survivin' Is knowin' what to throw away and knowing what to keep<br><br>“You have found a real keeper here!” Classic coastal furnishings and all solid surface flooring set the stage for a relaxing beachy vibe…just what you have been looking for. Enjoy even more shopping, dining and attractions at nearby popular areas like Rosemary Beach and Pier Park. Bike or walk to nearby Inlet Beach public access point and on out onto the gorgeous sugary white sand of the Gulf beach with its sparkling Emerald green water and fresh salty breezes. With all of the excitement of Panama City Beach to the East, Destin and its marvelous tourist appeal to the West, and the charm and natural beauty of 30A just minutes away, you have the winning hand!<br><br>Shopping, Dining & Entertainment<br>Seaside – 10 miles<br>Alys Beach – 1.8 miles<br>Rosemary Beach – 1 mile<br>Shades Bar & Grill – 0.4 mile<br>30Avenue – 500 ft<br>Publix Shopping Center – 3 miles<br>Winn-Dixie and CVS Pharmacy – 3 miles<br>Pier Park – 10 miles<br><br>Outdoors & Sports<br>Public Beach Access – 0.7 mile<br>Pedestrian Underpass on Hwy 98 – 0.3 mile *coming soon*<br>Camp Helen State Park – 1.8 miles<br>Lake Powell Park with boat launch and swimming area – 1 block<br><br>Makin My Way Along 30A…Inlet Beach<br>You'll never run out of aces here!<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br>Must Be 25 To Book<br>No Smoking<br>Cancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>Sheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>All Kitchens Fully-Equipped With Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>Basic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, Etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
